# promise: #387
# A favorite's right-click menu has Arc's Mute row after Rename… (Arc 1.172's favorite menu: Copy
# Link, Share ›, Change Icon…, Rename…, Mute, Edit Pinned Page ›, …). Mute silences the page without
# opening it, and on a muted favorite the row says Unmute and brings the sound back (GitHub #387).
# The tab rows' menu has had Mute from the start; favorites were missing it.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=fav
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 1
cra://action/favoriteTab
wait 1
# Another tab in front, so the favorite is muted from its tile without being the open page.
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=other
wait 1
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=before
expect-log favorite menu before: [^|]*Remove from Favorites\|Rename…\|Mute\|
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=mute&run=Mute
expect-log favorite menu mute ran Mute: saved=muted page=muted$
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=muted
expect-log favorite menu muted: [^|]*Remove from Favorites\|Rename…\|Unmute\|
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=unmute&run=Unmute
expect-log favorite menu unmute ran Unmute: saved=unmuted page=unmuted$
